{"nodeDefinition":{"details":"Details - JS function that creates JSON object based on incoming message. This object will be added into Alarm.details field.
Node output:
If alarm was not created, original message is returned. Otherwise new Message returned with type 'ALARM', Alarm object in 'msg' property and 'metadata' will contains one of those properties 'isNewAlarm/isExistingAlarm'. Message payload can be accessed via <code>msg</code> property. For example <code>'temperature = ' + msg.temperature ;</code>. Message metadata can be accessed via <code>metadata</code> property. For example <code>'name = ' + metadata.customerName;</code>.","description":"Create or Update Alarm","inEnabled":true,"outEnabled":true,"relationTypes":["Created","Updated","False","Failure"],"customRelations":false,"ruleChainNode":false,"defaultConfiguration":{"alarmType":"General Alarm","scriptLang":"TBEL","alarmDetailsBuildJs":"var details = {};
if (metadata.prevAlarmDetails) {
    details = JSON.parse(metadata.prevAlarmDetails);
    //remove prevAlarmDetails from metadata
    delete metadata.prevAlarmDetails;
    //now metadata is the same as it comes IN this rule node
}


return details;","alarmDetailsBuildTbel":"var details = {};
if (metadata.prevAlarmDetails != null) {
    details = JSON.parse(metadata.prevAlarmDetails);
    //remove prevAlarmDetails from metadata
    metadata.remove('prevAlarmDetails');
    //now metadata is the same as it comes IN this rule node
}


return details;","severity":"CRITICAL","propagate":false,"propagateToOwner":false,"propagateToTenant":false,"useMessageAlarmData":false,"overwriteAlarmDetails":false,"dynamicSeverity":false,"relationTypes":[]},"uiResources":[],"configDirective":"tbActionNodeCreateAlarmConfig","icon":"notifications_active","iconUrl":"","docUrl":"https://thingsboard.io/docs/user-guide/rule-engine-2-0/nodes/action/create-alarm/"}}

